# Video Calling Module - Project Overview

SvelteKit app using Azure Communication Services (ACS) for video calling, chat, and recording.

## Tech Stack
- **Framework**: SvelteKit with Svelte 5 (runes)
- **Runtime**: Deno
- **Language**: TypeScript with Zod validation
- **Styling**: Shoelace components
- **Azure SDKs**: communication-rooms, communication-identity, communication-react, call-automation

## Architecture

```
src/lib/
├── schemas/          # Zod schemas (shared types)
├── stores/           # Svelte 5 class-based stores (*.svelte.ts)
├── server/
│   ├── services/     # Business logic (Azure SDK operations)
│   └── db/           # JSON file database layer
└── utils/            # Shared utilities (logger, formatZodErrors)

src/routes/
├── api/v1/           # REST API endpoints
└── meeting/[groupId] # Meeting UI pages
```

## Key Patterns
- Use `$lib` alias for imports
- Export via barrel files (index.ts)
- Server-only code in `$lib/server`
- Validate ALL inputs with Zod schemas
